{"id":"473212636","kind":"article","title":"情景体验成为大众媒体时蕴藏极大潜力","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6oXuXLZ7Wq1eBqskyfph2wz9gjohQUKSBFzx"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"助记媒介 & 思想工具","date":"2022-03-02","updated":"2024-05-18","votes":9,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":665,"keywords":["情景体验","大众媒介","赋能环境","交互设计","学习体验"],"summary":"作者认为，情景体验有潜力成为传递思想、价值和实践的大众媒介，因为它能让参与者与作者意图建立联系，并引导人们投入赋能环境。文章指出，学徒制等形式不易大规模传播，电子游戏多用于审美体验，因而提出参考引导式冥想应用，探索可扩展的情景体验。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/473212636","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"MYeS8NKm\">我相信有可能创造出一种<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3KASfpz5AmNmqM2m517Jbs1EvXrLN7NkeYWH\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，其主要目的是交流思想、价值观和实践——类似于完成一本书的「工作」。这是一个强有力的主张，因为<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6rE2jCvARneUxogtFCTMafzJvYEKWFgb51c2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验可以创造出个人与作者意图的强烈联系</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，并且<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2FDTR2NfpW1AtA4SAETevmKC2uDGEHfKrbhG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验可以引导人们积极参与到赋能环境中</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"QYVX5y25\">途径：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"_UmQjaT1\"> 现在，学徒制和其他社会机构（如 YC）也这样做，但这些都不是大众媒体的形式（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2K87JksHrc9UDQR2PoTxXeRNdJA1Wo9N8Au2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验很难分发</a>）<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"_hlpZsQ2\"> 电子游戏是大众媒体，但它们几乎只被用来传达审美体验，而不是作为赋能环境的一部分<br/> <br/></li><li data-pid=\"7Mq3N6dZ\"> 冥想 App 是不错的参考：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zEaAK3UY2JrTVBA2mVGJqn5knxfiQbVz7Cq\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">引导式冥想 App 在大众媒体中提供情景体验</a><br/> </li></ul><p data-pid=\"8pJu7Tj0\">我认为这是 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2LSeViHDq9uQaPzrQvUgqsotZTKRgBZMm24x\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The Primer++</a> 的核心思想之一。</p><p data-pid=\"BPoi9C7Y\">这似乎与<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z87TFgTr98bz3MNFT26NhegyRCMgdkfNTBAzp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">交互是界面设计中的成本中心</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>有本质上的矛盾。</p><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"uR7R-ijJ\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"698476935\" href=\"#/post/698476935\">§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》</a></li><li data-pid=\"wp_2aJTs\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463926133\" href=\"#/post/463926133\">情景体验</a></li><li data-pid=\"_Sjcqabk\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"421908250\" href=\"#/post/421908250\">常青笔记的标题就像 API</a></li><li data-pid=\"nBws4qR5\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"474498160\" href=\"#/post/474498160\">大众媒介通常不善于帮助人们落实想法</a></li><li data-pid=\"9HkH7jcv\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"608096379\" href=\"#/post/608096379\">§最关心的事情</a></li><li data-pid=\"pS28rAqg\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654019484\" href=\"#/post/654019484\">情景体验可以引导人们积极参与到赋能环境中</a></li><li data-pid=\"dpdnqQ3O\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"694282984\" href=\"#/post/694282984\">Y Combinator</a></li><li data-pid=\"npivI5v4\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"694626102\" href=\"#/post/694626102\">设计新的赋能环境，可以看作是在打造一所超级大学（University++）</a></li><li data-pid=\"zGudn2lX\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"695554301\" href=\"#/post/695554301\">《启蒙琼林》具备良好的扩展性</a></li><li data-pid=\"I2qVWSQB\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"697566052\" href=\"#/post/697566052\">超级《启蒙琼林》被嵌入到一个领域中，通过情景体验来引导学习者参与</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"EXe-X8pe\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"zRjpvapU\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6oXuXLZ7Wq1eBqskyfph2wz9gjohQUKSBFzx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Enacted experiences have incredible potential as a mass medium (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 情景体验 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463926133\" href=\"#/post/463926133\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 情景体验可以创造出个人与作者意图的强烈联系 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"656108634\" href=\"#/post/656108634\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 情景体验可以引导人们积极参与到赋能环境中 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654019484\" href=\"#/post/654019484\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 交互是界面设计中的成本中心 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"472770296\" href=\"#/post/472770296\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"472770296","title":"交互是界面设计中的成本中心","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"474498160","title":"大众媒介通常不善于帮助人们落实想法","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":8,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 助记媒介 & 思想工具"},{"id":"694282984","title":"Y Combinator","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"608096379","title":"§最关心的事情","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"698476935","title":"§赋能环境、游戏和《启蒙琼林》","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":9,"minutes":6,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}